  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d0ccca1471d34164ba6a48d39b9b87a9, type: 3}
  m_Name: PolaroidPuzzleTidbit
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BoundSpiritRuntime::InformationalTidbitData
  title: 
  body: "By dragging the Polaroids into the right order \u2014 baby photo (2001),
    first day of school (2008), soccer years, study sessions \u2014 you rebuilt someone\u2019s
    whole timeline.\r\nIn cybersecurity, this is a real thing: when people post lots
    of photos or memories online, others can piece together their life story the
    same way you just did. And the more someone learns about you \u2014 your hobbies,
    your friends, your important years \u2014 the easier it becomes to guess passwords,
    answer security questions, or predict patterns.\r\nRearranging photos is fun
    in a puzzle\u2026 but in real life, sharing too much can give strangers a full
    picture you didn\u2019t mean to reveal.\r\n"
